{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226700","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226700","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1222670001:1":{"text":"...일단 나리안은 당분간 구금하고, 실비나는 중범죄자 감옥에 가두겠습니다.","source_cn":"……事情就是这样，纳莉安我们暂时羁押起来，而西尔维娜被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89B7E27DD4B7B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222670002:1":{"text":"그리고 그녀에게서 이것을 찾아냈습니다...","source_cn":"以及，我们从她身上找到了这个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB71FD70B7016956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"그레이브본 성물","source_cn":"亡灵圣器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x250EAA1E289E7D25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222670003:1":{"text":"...역시 반티스 성물이군. 돌고 돌아 드디어 우리 손에 다시 돌아오게 되었어.","source_cn":"……果然是班题斯圣器。兜兜转转，总算回到了我们的手上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EA92DAE3EB7DA40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222670004:0":{"text":"좋아. 가서 그 그레이브본 킬러를 데리고 오도록. 내가 직접 심문하도록 하지.","source_cn":"很好，现在把那个亡灵杀手带来，我要亲自审讯她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9503E5B37270DAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222670005:0":{"text":"두목, 여기 데려왔습니다!","source_cn":"当家，人带过来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CABF91DF78AB33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222670006:1":{"text":"...나 혼자서도 걸을 수 있어! ","source_cn":"……我自己会走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1BA9A25B6DEC0A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222670007:1":{"text":"네가 실비나? 죽음의 함대와는 무슨 관계지? 반티스 성물은 왜 빼앗아 간 거고?","source_cn":"你就是西尔维娜？你与死潮舰队是什么关系？为什么要抢夺班...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F8056BA2466692C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222670008:1":{"text":"나리안을 풀어줘.","source_cn":"放了纳莉安。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEFEAC18890B868E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222670009:1":{"text":"뭐?","source_cn":"什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F10522BBA1B0CFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222670010:1":{"text":"나리안을 풀어주면 말해주지.","source_cn":"先放了纳莉安，该说的我会说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF99DE6D964B67E19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222670011:0":{"text":"좋아. 베인, 가서 나리안을 풀어주도록 해.","source_cn":"可以。瓦因，你去传话，拿我的手令去把纳莉安放了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14CA2CAE5957DC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222670012:0":{"text":"우리 블러디 로즈의 일 처리 방식은 너도 잘 알겠지. 난 한 입으로 두말하지 않아. 풀어주겠다고 말했으니 풀어주겠어.","source_cn":"我们血薇帮的行事你应该也清楚，我不会出尔反尔，说放人就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x189488DF9A62B954","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222670013:1":{"text":"...알겠어. 네 질문에 대답하지.","source_cn":"……明白了，我会回答你的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x851505CAB5E5EC03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222670014:1":{"text":"난 반티스 제국에서 왔고, 해골왕을 위해 일하고 있어. 주로 하는 일은 입막음, 암살, 그리고 밀살이지.","source_cn":"我来自班题斯帝国，为骸骨之王效力。主要工作是封口、行刺...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47B88DC8FF21501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222670015:1":{"text":"그 세 가지가 크게 다른가요...?","source_cn":"这三件事有什么差别吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E8F3AC9D89D9F97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222670016:1":{"text":"전문적인 관점에서 보면 차이가 아주 커.","source_cn":"从专业角度来说，差异很大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD402D63FA9E7336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222670017:1":{"text":"그렇군요... 실비나 양, 당신이 러스트 항에 온 건 반티스 성물 때문인가요?","source_cn":"好吧……西尔维娜小姐，你来到锈锚港，是为了班题斯圣器吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E3D0CEC5A1ED122","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222670018:1":{"text":"해골왕의 명을 받고 그의 반티스 성물을 회수하러 왔어.","source_cn":"我接受骸骨之王的命令，前来回收属于他的班题斯圣器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A20A467421F40DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222670019:1":{"text":"하지만 내 임무는 실패했으니, 여기서 끝난 셈이야.","source_cn":"但我的任务已经失败，到此为止了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC30CBC37FE357B71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222670020:1":{"text":"...성물을 회수하지 못했으니 해골왕이 가만히 있지 않을 거라는 건가?","source_cn":"……圣器没能回收，骸骨之王不会就这样善罢甘休？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB46C1351A1523A3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222670021:1":{"text":"맞아.","source_cn":"没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8D40D82DFFDE8C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222670022:0":{"text":"내가 실패했다는 소식이 제국에 알려지면 두 번째 엘리트 킬러가 러스트 항으로 와서 내가 완수하지 못한 사명을 완수하게 될 거야.","source_cn":"等我失败的消息传回帝国，会有第二批精英杀手来到锈锚港，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0007AC7098B0E90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222670023:0":{"text":"음, 이해했어. 여기, 실비나를 데리고 가.","source_cn":"我知道了。来人，带她回牢房。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC54ABE4DBE62EB8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:35:1222670024:0":{"text":"실비나가 연행되자, 소니아는 깊은 생각에 잠겼다...","source_cn":"西尔维娜被带走后，索尼娅陷入沉思——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC084B443757A364E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222670025:0":{"text":"소니아, 실비나의 말을 들어보니 반티스 제국에서 성물을 빼앗아 가기 위해 러스트 항으로 또 사람을 보내올 것 같네요.","source_cn":"索尼娅，听她的意思，班题斯帝国还会派人来锈锚港抢夺圣器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C097D4A07341D78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222670026:0":{"text":"성물이 남아있는 이상, 러스트 항의 분쟁은 끝이 없을 거예요...","source_cn":"只要留着圣器，锈锚港的纷争将会没完没了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B900C0CF784671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222670027:1":{"text":"블러디 로즈에 성물이 무슨 쓸모가 있나요?","source_cn":"圣器对血薇帮来说有什么用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77EB3AA1841D0E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1222670028:1":{"text":"꼭 무슨 쓸모가 있는 건 아니야, 하지만 성물이 죽음의 함대로 돌아갈까 봐 걱정되는 것뿐.","source_cn":"没用，但我们担心圣器回到死潮舰队手中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B95B03F267FA22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1222670029:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 실비나에게 맡기는 것도 한 가지 방법일 수도 있겠네요.","source_cn":"或许……交给西尔维娜也是一种选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9459C5D3A0988236","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1222670030:1":{"text":"만약 실비나를 놓아주지 않으면 어떻게 처벌할 생각이세요?","source_cn":"如果不放走她，你们打算怎么处置她呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA522540B473F06F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1222670031:0":{"text":"아직은 결정하지 못 했어. 내게 조금만 더 시간을 줘.","source_cn":"我还没想好，请再给我一些时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2364D1375D85B762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"루카","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:探子瓦因":{"text":"베인","source":"探子瓦因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西尔维娜":{"text":"실비나","source":"西尔维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"블랙 스크린","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":32,"speaker_count":7}}